error[S-Test]: a test is not called by name
  --> tests/decl/ineligible_functions_are_not_values.lin:12:46
   |
12 |     let _test: fn() -> Result[(), IoError] = checked
   |                                              ^^^^^^^ the compiler writes the only call to a test, so a program naming one would ship it
